    "Mahj Trainer cannot send reminders until notifications are turned on in iOS Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mahj Trainer kann erst erinnern, wenn Mitteilungen in den iOS-Einstellungen an sind."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mahj Trainer no puede enviarte recordatorios hasta que actives las notificaciones en los Ajustes de iOS."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mahj Trainer ne peut pas envoyer de rappels tant que les notifications sont désactivées dans les Réglages iOS."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mahj Trainer tidak bisa mengirim pengingat sampai notifikasi dinyalakan di Pengaturan iOS."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mahj Trainer chỉ gửi được lời nhắc khi bạn bật thông báo trong Cài đặt iOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mahj Trainer teaches American Mah Jongg skills with original practice hands. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the National Mah Jongg League. For official hands and values, pick up the current NMJL card.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mahj Trainer vermittelt American Mah Jongg mit eigenen Übungshänden. Die App ist nicht mit der National Mah Jongg League verbunden oder von ihr unterstützt. Offizielle Hände und Werte stehen auf der aktuellen NMJL-Karte."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mahj Trainer enseña Mah Jongg americano con manos de práctica originales. No está afiliada ni respaldada por la National Mah Jongg League. Para las manos y valores oficiales, consigue la tarjeta NMJL actual."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mahj Trainer enseigne le Mah Jongg américain avec des mains d'entraînement originales. L'app n'est ni affiliée ni approuvée par la National Mah Jongg League. Pour les mains et valeurs officielles, procurez-vous la carte NMJL actuelle."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mahj Trainer mengajarkan Mah Jongg Amerika dengan tangan latihan orisinal. Aplikasi ini tidak berafiliasi dengan atau didukung oleh National Mah Jongg League. Untuk tangan dan nilai resmi, gunakan kartu NMJL terbaru."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mahj Trainer dạy kỹ năng Mạt chược Mỹ với các bộ bài luyện tập do chúng tôi tự soạn. Ứng dụng không liên kết hay được bảo trợ bởi National Mah Jongg League. Để xem bộ bài và điểm chính thức, hãy dùng thẻ NMJL hiện hành."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mahj Trainer teaches skills for American Mah Jongg with original practice hands. It is not affiliated with the National Mah Jongg League. For official hands and values, get the current NMJL card.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
